OL,3,GNEWSAHorse road incidents in Kent top
OL,4,A520 since 2016
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 520 road incidents involving
OL,7,Fhorses have been reported in Kent since
OL,8,F2016, according to the British Horse
OL,9,FSociety (BHS).
OL,11,FThe charity said 82 collisions
OL,12,Finvolving horses and vehicles were
OL,13,Frecorded in the county in 2025,
OL,14,Fincluding one horse fatality.
OL,16,FRiders and campaigners say more
OL,17,Foff-road routes would provide a safer
OL,18,Falternative to busy roads and help
OL,19,Fprevent accidents.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
