OL,3,GNEWSAHorse road incidents in Kent top
OL,4,A520 since 2016
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Kent County Council (KCC) said while
OL,7,Fsafe and accessible riding routes were
OL,8,Fimportant, but creating or upgrading
OL,9,Fpaths was "complex and voluntary
OL,10,Fdedications were rare".
